---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Prima Digital — web development studio building on CMS platforms, plugins, and SaaS.">
  <div class="about">
    <p class="lead">Prima Digital is a web development studio. We've built on CMS platforms for years — and we're expanding into plugins across those platforms and, eventually, our own SaaS products.</p>

    <p>This site is the process log for that last part. Building with AI tools is genuinely different from building client work, and we're working out how to do it properly — the runbooks, the pre-build locks, the failure modes. That's what's here.</p>

    <p>I'm John, director at Prima Digital. Masters from UBC, undergrad at UofC, spent time at larger web dev shops before this. Previously a director at WiPro Technologies — they're still a current client, which tells you something. Based in Vancouver. Skis, cycles, runs, swims.</p>

    <p>If you're working through similar things or want to talk about the process: <a href="mailto:john@primadigital.net">john@primadigital.net</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .about .lead {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .about p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
